1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,630
Dawn delivery.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:07,350
Sign for the box, keeper.

3
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,710
The wall says the street said no.

4
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,020
The vote was last night.

5
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,800
Who held the chalk last?

6
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:25,870
Four hundred bells. Never dropped one.

7
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,350
At dawn I was holding this box. Here.

8
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,430
Your sleeve's been holding chalk all morning.

9
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:34,770
The street voted yes.

10
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,770
You scraped their yes off the wall.

11
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,080
Sign for the box, keeper.

12
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:48,680
There's the vote. On your sleeve.

13
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,220
Your name's up, Watcher.

